          {
            "section_type": "example_question",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Calculate <span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\left(\\dfrac{2x}{3}\\right)^4.]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "Calculate [MATH: \\left(\\dfrac{2x}{3}\\right)^4.]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>EXPLANATION</p>",
            "readable_text": "EXPLANATION",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "example_explanation",
            "normalized_html": "<p>First, we apply the power of quotient rule:</p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: ((2x)/(3))^{4} = ((2x)^{4})/(3^{4})]</span></p><p>Then, we apply the power rule and simplify:</p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: ((2x)^{4})/(3^{4})|=; (2^{4}x^{4})/(3^{4})|=; (16x^{4})/(81)]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "First, we apply the power of quotient rule:\n\n[MATH: ((2x)/(3))^{4} = ((2x)^{4})/(3^{4})]\n\nThen, we apply the power rule and simplify:\n\n[MATH: ((2x)^{4})/(3^{4})|=; (2^{4}x^{4})/(3^{4})|=; (16x^{4})/(81)]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          }
        ],
        "images": [],
        "free_entry_blanks": [],
        "select_lists": [],
        "readable_text": "Example Prompt:\nCalculate [MATH: \\left(\\dfrac{2x}{3}\\right)^4.]\n\nContent:\nEXPLANATION\n\nExplanation:\nFirst, we apply the power of quotient rule:\n\n[MATH: ((2x)/(3))^{4} = ((2x)^{4})/(3^{4})]\n\nThen, we apply the power rule and simplify:\n\n[MATH: ((2x)^{4})/(3^{4})|=; (2^{4}x^{4})/(3^{4})|=; (16x^{4})/(81)]"
      },
