          {
            "section_type": "example_question",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Simplify <span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\left(\\dfrac{y}{2}\\right)^3 \\left(\\dfrac{2y}{3}\\right)^2.]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "Simplify [MATH: \\left(\\dfrac{y}{2}\\right)^3 \\left(\\dfrac{2y}{3}\\right)^2.]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>EXPLANATION</p>",
            "readable_text": "EXPLANATION",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "example_explanation",
            "normalized_html": "<p>First, we apply the power of quotient rule:</p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: ((y)/(2))^{3}((2y)/(3))^{2} = (y^{3})/(2^{3}) \u22c5 ((2y)^{2})/(3^{2})]</span></p><p>Next, we apply the power rule:</p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: (y^{3})/(2^{3}) \u22c5 ((2y)^{2})/(3^{2})|=; (y^{3})/(8) \u22c5 (2^{2}y^{2})/(9)|=; (y^{3})/(8) \u22c5 (4y^{2})/(9)]</span></p><p>Finally, we apply the product rule and simplify:</p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: (y^{3})/(8) \u22c5 (4y^{2})/(9)|=; (4y^{(3 + 2)})/(72)|=; (4y^{5})/(72)|=; (y^{5})/(18)]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "First, we apply the power of quotient rule:\n\n[MATH: ((y)/(2))^{3}((2y)/(3))^{2} = (y^{3})/(2^{3}) \u22c5 ((2y)^{2})/(3^{2})]\n\nNext, we apply the power rule:\n\n[MATH: (y^{3})/(2^{3}) \u22c5 ((2y)^{2})/(3^{2})|=; (y^{3})/(8) \u22c5 (2^{2}y^{2})/(9)|=; (y^{3})/(8) \u22c5 (4y^{2})/(9)]\n\nFinally, we apply the product rule and simplify:\n\n[MATH: (y^{3})/(8) \u22c5 (4y^{2})/(9)|=; (4y^{(3 + 2)})/(72)|=; (4y^{5})/(72)|=; (y^{5})/(18)]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          }
        ],
        "images": [],
