        "select_lists": [],
        "readable_text": "Example Prompt:\nSimplify [MATH: \\left(\\dfrac{y}{2}\\right)^3 \\left(\\dfrac{2y}{3}\\right)^2.]\n\nContent:\nEXPLANATION\n\nExplanation:\nFirst, we apply the power of quotient rule:\n\n[MATH: ((y)/(2))^{3}((2y)/(3))^{2} = (y^{3})/(2^{3}) \u22c5 ((2y)^{2})/(3^{2})]\n\nNext, we apply the power rule:\n\n[MATH: (y^{3})/(2^{3}) \u22c5 ((2y)^{2})/(3^{2})|=; (y^{3})/(8) \u22c5 (2^{2}y^{2})/(9)|=; (y^{3})/(8) \u22c5 (4y^{2})/(9)]\n\nFinally, we apply the product rule and simplify:\n\n[MATH: (y^{3})/(8) \u22c5 (4y^{2})/(9)|=; (4y^{(3 + 2)})/(72)|=; (4y^{5})/(72)|=; (y^{5})/(18)]"
